{"sdkfz251_1_stuka" "The SdKfz 251/1 Was a World War II German armored fighting vehicle designed by the Hanomag company, based on its earlier, unarmored SdKfz 11 vehicle. The 251/1 was designed with Rocket launcher called the Stuka zu Fuss equipped with six side mounted frames for launching 280mm or 320mm Wurfkoerper rockets."}
